1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,467
Geppetto, the Puppet Master: he runs his show for a few days, then adds as many

2
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:06,103
people to his family as he can.

3
00:00:06,323 --> 00:00:07,603
Here's how he plays.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:12,565
Put the Puppets card next to his Killer board, with all three Puppet tokens on its

5
00:00:12,565 --> 00:00:13,169
Ready space.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,121
The Puppets are Minions with one health and an attack of one.

7
00:00:17,121 --> 00:00:20,293
They move as fast as Geppetto, which rises with his Bloodlust.

8
00:00:20,513 --> 00:00:24,286
They're on strings, so they must end their movement within two spaces of him.

9
00:00:24,286 --> 00:00:26,785
When one is killed, it goes on the Exhausted space.

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,914
Until the Finale, each Killer phase spawns a Ready Puppet in his space, then moves

11
00:00:31,914 --> 00:00:33,808
any Exhausted Puppets back to Ready.

12
00:00:34,028 --> 00:00:38,273
When a Terror card's Killer Action doesn't say it's for Puppets only, every Puppet

13
00:00:38,273 --> 00:00:40,705
resolves it in turn, then Geppetto does it too.

14
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:45,416
With Immortal Master, he can't be killed while all three Puppets are on the board.

15
00:00:45,636 --> 00:00:49,744
His Epic Dark Power, Join the Family, drops you to your Final Health if all three

16
00:00:49,744 --> 00:00:51,012
Puppets reach your space.

17
00:00:51,833 --> 00:00:56,139
A few tips. Every Puppet copies his actions, so killing them cuts his damage, and

18
00:00:56,139 --> 00:00:58,212
keeping one dead stops Immortal Master.

19
00:00:58,432 --> 00:01:02,421
Pick one plan early, rescuing or attacking, rather than splitting your effort.

20
00:01:02,641 --> 00:01:05,379
Watch for Puppets gathering round groups of Victims.

21
00:01:05,379 --> 00:01:05,905
Good luck.

